    "end_line": 74,
    "text": "\\begin{equation}\n  \\begin{aligned}\n    q_{\\bm{e}}(\\bm{x})\n      &=\\prod_{\\alpha\\in\\mathcal{F}}f_\\alpha(\\bm{x}_{D_\\alpha})\n        \\prod_{i\\in V}\\ell_i(x_i),\\\\\n    Z_{\\bm{e}}&=\\sum_{\\bm{x}}q_{\\bm{e}}(\\bm{x}),\\qquad\n    p(\\bm{x}\\mid\\bm{e})=\\frac{q_{\\bm{e}}(\\bm{x})}{Z_{\\bm{e}}}.\n  \\end{aligned}\n  \\label{eq:pgm-junction-tree-evidence-weight}\n\\end{equation}"
